Domain: {{ item }}
Publish MX: {{ item }}. 3600 IN MX 10 {{ mail_hostname }}.
Publish A: {{ mail_hostname }}. 3600 IN A <YOUR_PUBLIC_IPV4>
Merge SPF into your ONE existing SPF record (include other legitimate senders):
{{ item }}. 3600 IN TXT "v=spf1 mx ~all"
_dmarc.{{ item }}. 3600 IN TXT "v=DMARC1; p=none"
Publish DKIM TXT from /etc/opendkim/olamidepanel/{{ item }}/{{ mail_selector }}.txt
Ask hosting provider to set IPv4 PTR to {{ mail_hostname }}.
Use {{ mail_hostname }} for IMAPS 993 and SMTP STARTTLS 587; login with full email address.
Existing mail providers: migrate mailboxes first, then change MX. DNS is not changed by this playbook.
